### Archive Service API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Archive Transactions
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/archive/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entityType": "TRANSACTIONS",
  "startDate": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2024-03-31T23:59:59Z",
  "description": "Q1 2024 transaction archive",
  "storageTier": "HOT",
  "compressionType": "GZIP",
  "tags": ["Q1", "2024", "transactions"],
  "deleteAfterArchive": true,
  "createIndex": true,
  "priority": "MEDIUM"
}

### Archive Weight Measurements
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/archive/measurements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entityType": "WEIGHT_MEASUREMENTS",
  "startDate": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2024-03-31T23:59:59Z",
  "description": "Q1 2024 weight measurements archive",
  "storageTier": "WARM",
  "compressionType": "GZIP",
  "tags": ["Q1", "2024", "measurements"],
  "deleteAfterArchive": true,
  "createIndex": true,
  "priority": "MEDIUM"
}

### Archive Compliance Records
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/archive/compliance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entityType": "COMPLIANCE_RECORDS",
  "startDate": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2024-03-31T23:59:59Z",
  "description": "Q1 2024 compliance records archive",
  "storageTier": "HOT",
  "compressionType": "GZIP",
  "tags": ["Q1", "2024", "compliance"],
  "deleteAfterArchive": false,
  "createIndex": true,
  "priority": "HIGH"
}

### Get Archive History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/archive/history?entityType=TRANSACTIONS&startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2024-12-31

### Search Archived Data
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "searchTerm": "transaction",
  "entityTypes": ["TRANSACTIONS"],
  "startDate": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2024-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "sortBy": "ArchivedDate",
  "sortOrder": "DESC",
  "pageNumber": 1,
  "pageSize": 20,
  "includeMetadata": true,
  "highlightResults": true
}

### Search Suggestions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search/suggestions?query=trans&entityType=TRANSACTIONS&maxSuggestions=10

### Storage Report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/storage

### Activity Report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/activity